#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1027 expect=skipped domain=TA
#note "FRESH. ETCD is present, ELEMENT is not. Pins that Requirements.Variables.All is ALL-OF: ScopeMatcher.describeVariablesMismatch loops [ELEMENT, ETCD] and returns on the FIRST unsatisfied entry, so one missing column of the two is enough to reject the dataset. Keeping ETCD is what makes the fixture discriminating -- an any-of gate would have executed here."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset TA class="TRIAL DESIGN" label="Trial Arms"
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN  type=Char
col ARMCD   type=Char
col ARM     type=Char
col TAETORD type=Num
col ETCD    type=Char label="Element Code"
---
S1 | TA | A1 | Drug A | 1 | SCRN
S1 | TA | A1 | Drug A | 2 | TRT
